    /**
     * Safely expands the contents of an archive into {@code targetDirectory}.
     *
     * <p>Each entry name is validated to prevent path‑traversal attacks. The method
     * resolves the entry against the target directory, normalizes the resulting
     * path, and ensures that the final location is still within the target
     * directory. Absolute paths, drive letters, and relative components such as
     * {@code ..} are rejected outright.</p>
